## Production Notes

**Sonic palette:** Fuzzy bass (Melvins), detuned guitars, cavernous reverb on vocals during verses, dry and aggressive on choruses

**Key CAS vocabulary preserved:** Charnel, cyclopean, tenebrous, phosphorescent, primordial, sempiternal, sibilant, garrulous, fastidious

**Key CAS imagery preserved:** Sable velvet shadows, liquefied obsidian/sooty quicksilver, geological slumber, chartreuse vapor, parchment skin on hollow bone

**Lyrical themes:** Cosmic indifference, the futility of defiance, consumption as entropy, memory of beauty corrupted by horror, divine slothfulness

**Dynamics:** Classic loud-quiet-loud structure; verses evoke creeping dread, choruses explode with visceral horror; bridge provides doom-laden respite before final collapse

**Vocal approach:** Whispered/spoken verses, belted/screamed choruses, spoken-word bridge delivered with detached, almost bored divine contempt
